---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/friends.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- Bob declines Alice
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#4 FriendAsked Alice
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@1000 conn#4 sends AnswerFriend Alice accept=false
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=7
-- Alice asks again, twice: Bob is asked once; the request expires after a minute
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#4 FriendAsked Alice
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@1000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@61000 tick
   -> send conn#2 Ping
   -> send conn#4 Ping
   -> send conn#6 Ping
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Bob notice=8
   -> send conn#4 FriendNotice Alice notice=9
-- an answer to a request that ended, and to one never made
@61000 conn#4 sends AnswerFriend Alice accept=true
   -> send conn#4 FriendNotice Alice notice=9
@61000 conn#4 sends AnswerFriend Carol accept=true
   -> send conn#4 FriendNotice Carol notice=9
-- Carol asks Bob and leaves before he answers
@61000 conn#6 sends AskFriend Bob
   -> send conn#4 FriendAsked Carol
   -> send conn#6 FriendNotice Bob notice=1
@61000 conn#6 closed: the client left
   -> store #13: save #3 at (963400, 278200) played 60s
   -> send conn#4 FriendNotice Carol notice=9
   -> send conn#2 EntityRemove vid=3
   -> send conn#4 EntityRemove vid=3
   -> event: conn#6: closed: the client left
@61000 store answers #13: saved: Ok(())
-- nobody of that name in the game; our own name and no name are ignored
@61000 conn#2 sends AskFriend Carol
   -> send conn#2 FriendNotice Carol notice=2
@61000 conn#2 sends AskFriend alice
   -> event: conn#2: ignored AskFriend
@61000 conn#2 sends AskFriend B-o-b
   -> event: conn#2: ignored AskFriend
